WEBVTT

00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:04.560
"Let's Ask!" Here are today's guests!

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:08.330
I believe that a light novel will 
win the Naoki Prize next year.

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:10.070
I'm Chiharu Harukaze.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:11.990
<b>Chiharu Harukaze</b>

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.030
Kayura Tsurugino.

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:17.490
Recently, I've been learning 
Zentradi by listening to it.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.490
<b>Kayura Tsurugino</b>

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.500
<b>Today's Theme: Maids</b>

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:21.500
Today's theme is maids.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:26.000
M-Maids?! Why do I have 
to talk about maids?!

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:27.770
Just because.

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:29.230
If anyone can, it's you.

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:30.710
What makes you so sure?!

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.200
As someone who was raised on 
manga, anime, and video games...

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:36.470
I had a hunch.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:38.760
Okay, here's the first question.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.930
What is particularly 
important for a maid?

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:43.930
A fake smile.

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:47.830
That's very honest of you...

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:51.440
If you can fake a smile naturally, 
you can fool 80 percent of people.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.220
Speaking from experience, huh?

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:56.360
N-No! I'm not a maid!

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.270
Next, tell us about what 
could be called the maid's

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:00.870
special technique, the "maid turn."

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.410
Like this.

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:07.040
No, no. More like this.

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:08.760
That's totally maid.

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.360
Wonderfully maid-like!

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:12.000
N-No! I'm not—

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:53.060
<b>Idiots, Tests, 
and Spice</b>

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.740
That was better than 
the rumors suggested.

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:56.180
The heroine was especially great.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:59.320
Her unique speech 
patterns were really cute.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:04.450
"My lord, you promised 
you would take me north,

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:09.160
but please... don't 
look at me any more..."

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:16.170
Hey! Aika-san! W-Wait a second!

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:21.430
You're surprisingly unguarded, 
aren't you, Chiharu-san?

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:25.910
Not at all! You just have good timing!

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:26.650
Really?

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:27.950
Yes, really!

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:30.430
What about me is unguarded, anyway?

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.160
Well...

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:34.690
Want a complete list?

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:37.680
<b>Japunica
Weaknesses
 Book</b>

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:37.680
<b>Japunica
Assassination
Picture Book</b>

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.640
No thanks...

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:43.410
Well, that unguarded side of 
you is what makes you so cute.

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:48.940
<i>Am I really that unguarded?</i>

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.280
<i>No, surely not.</i>

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:54.980
<i>If you ask me, Hina is way 
more unguarded than I am.</i>

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:56.920
<i>That's right.</i>

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:59.300
<i>There are plenty of people 
who are more unguarded...</i>

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:02.330
<i>than... I... am...</i>

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:06.300
<i>Her panties are showing! 
She's way too unguarded!</i>

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:08.860
H-Hey, they're showing.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:11.300
Huh? What's showing?

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:13.810
Well, your... underwear.

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:15.370
My underwear?

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:21.820
You idiot! What do you 
think you're looking at?!

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:26.190
Honestly, without that butler, 
you're totally unguarded.

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:28.160
Who are you calling unguarded?!

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:31.830
If you ask me, Hinagiku is way 
more unguarded than I am!

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.000
<b>Idiots, Tests, 
and Spice</b>

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.000
Hey, that's...

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.310
You're reading that, too?

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:40.000
Yeah.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.210
Did you see the anime, too?

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:42.010
Of course.

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:43.970
You really get it.

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:45.840
So do you.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.580
This is really good, huh?

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:54.480
Yeah! Especially the 
cute way the heroine talks!

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:55.770
I totally fell for her!

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:58.190
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:04:58.610 --> 00:04:59.400
What?

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:02.540
The best part is the crossdressing!

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:03.970
The crossdressing!

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:06.320
The way the heroine 
talks is only secondary!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.700
No way!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.450
The heroine's cuteness 
is what matters most!

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.190
It's the crossdressing!

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:13.280
It's the speech patterns!

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:14.850
You just don't get it!

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:15.790
No, <i>you</i> don't get it!

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:20.110
The heroine is the best part! 
It's those unique speech patterns!

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:21.340
Watch. Like this.

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:24.760
Please... don't look at me any more...

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:28.090
What are you doing?

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:29.620
I... uh...

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:31.990
<i>What a blunder...</i>

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:34.820
<i>Does this mean I really am unguarded?</i>

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:38.010
<i>But plenty of other people 
have their unguarded sides...</i>

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:40.300
Excuse me, miss! 
Could you get our ball?

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:41.730
Okay, here it comes!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:45.590
I saw!

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:46.180
Did you see?!

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:47.260
Yeah, I saw!

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:49.700
<i>I knew there were plenty of others.</i>

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.030
I've got it!

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:56.780
<b>Beautiful 
Girl</b>

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:55.320
If each of these rich students 
would give me just a thousand yen,

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:57.620
I'd be a multi-millionaire in no time!

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:00.730
Now that that's decided, 
it's time to take action!

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:02.540
<i>Way too unguarded.</i>

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:05.560
<i>I don't know what part 
of that to comment on first.</i>

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:07.590
About the trip coming up...

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:10.550
What country is Istanbul 
the capital of again?

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:13.010
It starts with an E-sound, so maybe England?

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.580
Isn't Indus the capital of England?

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:17.980
No, Indus is the capital of India.

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:17.980
<i>Everyone here is so unguarded.</i>

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:21.340
Is everything okay at this school?

00:06:21.340 --> 00:06:22.820
Whoa, it's a pop fly!

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:23.900
President!

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:25.320
Look out!

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:30.580
Come on, guys, be careful.

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:31.450
Sorry!

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:35.700
<i>Sorry, Hina. I guess you're 
not unguarded after all.</i>

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:37.960
<i>I feel all confused...</i>

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:41.260
<i>I'll have to play some 
games to burn off stre—</i>

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.210
Nagi?! Why are you here?

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:48.720
I was feeling a little stressed.

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:50.370
What about you?

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:51.810
What does it matter?!

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:56.260
Why you... You're on 
the student council!

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:58.180
Should you really be here?

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:03.000
Hina takes care of all the serious 
student council business, so it's fine!

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.560
And you! You're rich, so
 just buy the game machine!

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:10.080
The charm of these games is 
playing them in places like this!

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:11.670
Hey! How dare you?!

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:13.250
Now you've done it!

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:17.030
Really, a girl playing racing 
games! You're so unguarded!

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:19.090
You're the one who's unguarded!

00:07:19.090 --> 00:07:20.040
How am I unguarded?!

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:25.000
Like the way the side of you that's 
not so cool spills out so easily.

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:28.550
See?! I'm right!

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:31.180
Shut up!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:36.320
People with multiple facets, 
like an unguarded side,

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:38.420
become alluring adults like Fujiko-chan!

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:39.600
Don't say that about yourself!

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:42.280
Hey!

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:43.200
Take that!

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:47.320
Miss Nagi and Chiharu-san seem 
almost like two peas in a pod...

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:50.280
Ladies, please, don't be 
so hard on the machines!

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:54.910
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:54.290
Both so unguarded.

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:02.870
Nagi.

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:05.070
Shall we hold a little get-together?

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:07.380
I ink not.

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:11.470
Why not?! If we all live 
under the same roof,

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:14.020
isn't it a good thing to 
deepen our relationships?!

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:16.760
What would you do for a 
get-together, anyway?

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:20.520
Well, since we have such a big 
yard, how about a barbecue?

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:22.390
Barbecue?

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:27.290
The high school girl comedian of our 
time, the bespectacled Horumon,

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:28.960
You're so simple.

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:30.290
takes her first shot 
at a gourmet review!

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:32.300
Th-That's not it! I didn't think 
of it because they did it on TV!

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:33.580
Besides...

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:37.040
You think you guys can throw a 
barbecue with the rent you pay?!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:40.580
W-Well, what can we do, then?

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.330
Hm, let's see...

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.210
A curry party, maybe?

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:48.920
Hey! Why'd you click 
your tongue like that?!

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:52.020
Fine! We'll have a get-together, then!

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:54.680
Hayate! Hey, Hayate!

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:59.070
Chiharu-san...

00:08:59.070 --> 00:08:59.930
Shopping run?

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:03.090
I'll help. It was my idea, after all.

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:04.300
Are you sure?

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:05.190
In return...

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:07.440
Please buy some meat!

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:12.930
Cheap stuff is fine! I just 
want a barbecue, not curry!

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:14.700
O-Okay...

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:18.620
<b>Hatsushiba
 Supermarket</b>

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:18.620
What would you like besides meat?

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.630
I hadn't thought of anything...

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:23.870
Just meat won't be enough. 
You'll need vegetables, too.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:27.880
<b>Huge Bargain!! 
White Peaches</b>

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:27.880
Oh, the peaches you like 
are on sale. Let's get some.

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:30.640
Really? I love peaches!

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:33.630
Wait... How did you 
know I like peaches?

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:36.880
You were eating them 
so happily not long ago.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:42.560
<i>He takes the heavier bag 
without a second thought,</i>

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.300
<i>naturally walks on the 
side closest to traffic,</i>

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:48.230
<i>and matches his speed 
with that of the girl.</i>

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:50.490
<i>I think I understand...</i>

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:54.320
Um... Something wrong?

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.640
Ayasaki-kun, you're the 
popular type, aren't you?

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:59.780
D-Don't joke around...

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:01.120
No, seriously.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:02.490
I'm not at all.

00:10:02.980 --> 00:10:05.960
Hinagiku-san gets angry 
at me all the time...

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:08.290
Well, I don't know about Hina,

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:10.250
but I think it makes girls happy

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:13.980
when you're so considerate of them 
without even thinking of it.

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:17.030
It makes them feel 
like they're cared for.

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:21.010
Hey, Ayasaki-kun... 
Can I ask you something?

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:26.350
If a girl told you 
that she loved you...

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:29.450
What would you do?

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:35.650
First, I'd ask if she's 
asking on the premise

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:37.540
that we'll be buried together.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:39.150
Suddenly, you're too serious...

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:43.160
What'd you come here for?

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:45.860
What do you mean? For the get-together.

00:10:45.860 --> 00:10:47.660
Chiharu invited me.

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:50.710
Uh, the get-together is 
for residents of this...

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:51.980
Coming in!

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:57.670
So, where's Hayate-kun?

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:59.340
He went shopping with Chiharu.

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:01.400
I-I see...

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:10.090
Typical idol. A single sigh 
makes a lovely image.

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.500
Nishizawa-san...

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:14.730
Is something wrong?

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:18.740
Actually... There's something
 I want to ask you.

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:22.770
If I told Hayate-kun that I loved him,

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:24.620
do you think he'd be my boyfriend?

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.660
Ruka's Counterattack 
Nishizawa took 254 damage!

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:28.730
Wh-Where did this come from?!

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:31.830
I realized when he taught 
me how to ride a bike...

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:35.800
that Hayate-kun is really 
the only one for me.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:39.260
So I think today will 
be a good opportunity

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:42.430
to confess to him and 
deepen our relationship...

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:46.050
<i>W-Wow... This is what 
an idol comes up with?</i>

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:48.430
<i>She's not hesitant like me at all!</i>

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.440
So, what do you think? 
Would it work out?

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:56.890
<i>I'm the only one who can stop this 
idol who's speeding out of control!</i>

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:01.640
If you told Hayate-kun you loved him,

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:03.330
I don't think he would accept it.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:04.610
Wh-Why not?

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:06.390
Just think about it.

00:12:06.390 --> 00:12:07.700
This apartment houses

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:11.810
all varieties of pretty girls, from 
the young to the fully mature!

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:12.960
And yet...

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:16.120
Hayate-kun has not made 
a move on any of them!

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:18.880
But that's just an issue of morals...

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:22.670
It's improbable for a normal boy 
to live in such an environment

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:24.580
without an impure thought.

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:26.760
Impossible. Unthinkable.

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:31.720
Are you saying there's something 
wrong with Hayate-kun?

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:33.720
Who knows?

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:35.900
But one thing is for sure.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.940
Ordinary appeal is not 
enough to get Hayate-kun.

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:40.730
He won't fall,

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:44.200
even if you're an idol!

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:46.290
I see.

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:49.190
So you're saying a simple 
confession won't change anything.

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:50.600
Then...

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:51.200
Then?

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:54.710
What if I just went 
for it and kissed him?

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:57.850
You're an idol! How can you say that?!

00:12:57.850 --> 00:13:00.410
Keep a cool head!

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:01.590
I'm sorry.

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:04.780
You're right... Yeah...

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:07.590
I'll go cool off and rethink this.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:10.110
<i>That was close.</i>

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:12.100
We're back.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.770
I'll leave these in the kitchen, okay?

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:17.380
Okay. Thank you.

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:20.230
Welcome back, Hayate-kun.

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:22.540
Ruka-san, welcome.

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:24.740
We'll be ready for the 
get-together soon.

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:27.530
There's something I want to ask you...

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:29.530
What is it?

00:13:30.050 --> 00:13:33.830
If a girl told you that she 
loved you, what would you do?

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:39.800
Wh-What do you think you're saying?

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:41.400
I'm not confessing to him.

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:42.820
It's the same thing!

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:45.190
Please, Ruka-san.

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:47.640
Chiharu-san just asked 
me the same thing.

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:49.470
Honestly, it's a bit problematic.

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:50.470
What?!

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:51.470
What?!

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:53.400
<i>Chiharu...</i>

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.630
<i>confessed to him...</i>

00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:59.280
I-Is that true, Hayate-kun?!

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:01.480
Yes, it's true.

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:05.670
Something like, "If you keep being 
so nice, I'll fall in love with you."

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:08.890
Honestly, it's a bit problematic 
being told things like that.

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:12.450
So it's... a problem?

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:16.670
Of course. There's no way she loves me.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.260
No matter how much 
Chiharu-san says things like that,

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:21.280
it's just embarrassing.

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:27.800
Are you supposed to season meat first?

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:30.300
Oh, yes. I'll do that now.

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:33.450
He really is impregnable.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.560
Yeah...

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:37.480
But I feel bad for Chiharu.

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:39.790
This meat looks so good!

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:41.110
Even though she's smiling and 
talking to him like that,

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.110
It sure does.

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:42.980
she must really be hurting.

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:44.740
Okay then!

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:46.570
Cheers!

00:14:57.270 --> 00:15:00.000
<i>Man, for someone so 
popular, he sure is dense.</i>

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:03.430
<i>Any girl who falls for him 
has really got it rough.</i>

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:07.400
Eat mine too, Chiharu.

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:09.220
Eat this and cheer up.

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:12.670
Uh, thanks...

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.970
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:15:14.270 --> 00:15:15.970
I know! I'll go to Akiba!

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:19.660
This season has a lot of anime 
based on light novels again.

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:20.870
It's hard to keep up.

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:23.900
Yeah, I haven't read the 
originals of several of them.

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.660
It makes it even harder when they're

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:28.740
based on gal games that you 
have to check by playing.

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:32.320
And even if you've already played 
them, the image is different...

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:35.310
How many are you planning 
to watch this season?

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:38.540
An advanced watcher really 
should watch at least 20.

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:42.980
W-Wait a minute. I think 
you're mistaken here.

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:44.340
I'm not an otaku.

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:46.910
Everyone who reads light 
novels, plays games,

00:15:46.910 --> 00:15:48.860
and watches anime is an otaku!

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:51.570
Th-That's prejudice!

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:54.850
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:54.850
Dark Angel.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:58.620
Maid Prism Power!

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:00.220
Transform!

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:04.590
I see. So that's how you 
flip your switch on.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.860
Is it good, Kayura-san?

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:16.080
Eat lots and have a good time.

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:20.500
This is no meat, boy, no meat.

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:23.580
Don't laugh.

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:25.510
The men are watching.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.590
<i>I guess that's one way...</i>

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:33.440
<i>Drawing his interest by 
assuming some weird character,</i>

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:35.090
<i>instead of being yourself...</i>

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:38.580
<i>Against Hayate-kun, who's far 
more considerate than most,</i>

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:39.850
<i>that should be highly effective!</i>

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:41.750
<i>You really can do it, Kayura.</i>

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:46.560
Let her be, Hayate. 
She's having plenty of fun.

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:48.390
I suppose so.

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:51.790
Don't worry. She's been this 
weird since you met her, right?

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:52.860
I suppose so.

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:56.210
Well, I'm quite impressed, kid.

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:58.370
I have to hand it to you, you certainly
 don't mince words, do you?

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:02.610
I remember when 
Kayura-san first came here.

00:17:02.610 --> 00:17:05.350
Yeah, she put up a tent here, right?

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:09.290
I never imagined she'd 
end up going to Hakuo.

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.050
Kayura-san, that outfit...

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:18.700
Cute, isn't it?

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:19.890
Yes, I guess...

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:23.040
You might not be familiar with it,

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:25.550
but this is a remarkably rare uniform

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:28.510
from a remarkable school 
called Hakuo Academy.

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:27.010
We're off!

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:28.160
We're off!

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:31.060
Feel honored that you got to see it.

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:35.260
Y-You may be right. I 
don't see that one often.

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:37.160
That's not all you should 
be surprised about.

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:39.040
As a matter of fact,

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:42.660
at the age of 13, I'm a high school 
second year after skipping grades

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.770
Oh... Really?

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:48.320
Th-That wasn't much of a reaction.

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:50.490
You're supposed to be 
more surprised by that.

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:51.540
Sorry...

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:52.670
Kayura!

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:56.470
We're at the same school starting today.

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:57.340
Let's be friends, okay?

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:01.380
You know how...

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:04.260
you take something you 
thought was a rare,

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:06.260
limited edition item to 
sell in a secondhand shop,

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:09.360
and find out it was 
actually really cheap?

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:11.230
Listen, you!

00:18:12.280 --> 00:18:14.300
But this is really amazing.

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:16.780
You must be very good 
at studying, Kayura-san.

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:19.350
I can complete six years of middle and

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:21.290
high school studies in three years.

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:22.740
Of course I'm working hard.

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:25.890
The teen years are short and I'm busy.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:29.150
Still, this place is too big.

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:31.990
I came here once to take the exam, 
but it looks like I could get lost.

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:33.750
Then, why don't we show you around?

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:35.300
For real?

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:37.050
Yes, of course.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:42.190
Why don't you show me what makes 
Hakuo Academy so high-class?

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:44.560
Then, take a look over there.

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:46.980
What is that?

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.310
Well, that...

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:50.800
has been there from the start,

00:18:50.800 --> 00:18:52.780
as far as the setting goes, 
but it's never been used.

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:54.800
It's a streetcar for 
getting around campus.

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:58.200
We had something that 
handy here?! I never knew!

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:00.630
It was put here so students could get

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:02.390
around the huge campus quickly,

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:04.260
but it's never been used.

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:05.950
No way! Let's use it!

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:07.340
This is a great opportunity!

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:10.080
Let's get around by streetcar 
from now on! Okay?

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.610
Okay, next...

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:13.410
We're still not riding it?!

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:16.110
Such wastefulness is proof of 
a high-class establishment.

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:17.510
It is?

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:21.470
Oh, here it is. The most famous 
part of Hakuo Academy.

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:24.380
Behold, the drunken teacher!

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:26.220
Come on...

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:30.210
That slovenly attire, that 
peaceful sleeping face...

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:35.110
In a way, perhaps she's 
teaching students that

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:38.020
they must not become this kind of adult.

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:39.700
I can't drink any more...

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:40.490
I see. Very deep.

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:41.360
Deeply asleep, you mean.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:43.410
Now, next is...

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:44.830
Oh, hang on a second.

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:46.820
Since we're here anyway,

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:49.280
I want to go up there.

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:58.650
This is more amazing than I'd imagined.

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:00.880
Yes, it is.

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:02.860
From this high up,

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:05.160
no one would even notice 
if you stripped naked.

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:09.230
But seeing the view from up here

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:12.140
makes me feel glad I came to 
this school for the first time.

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:15.550
<i>Huh? So she wasn't 
happy about it before?</i>

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:17.150
<i>I would think not.</i>

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:19.480
Nagi.

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.400
Once again, let's be friends.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:26.700
I think I'm going to enjoy 
life at this school.

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:32.320
Yeah. I hope we'll be friends, too.

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:37.310
I don't come to school 
very often, though.

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:38.590
That's bad, you know!

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:42.750
Hey, what's behind this door?

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:45.640
Oh, another of this school's

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:47.810
most famous things is behind that door.

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:49.350
Behind this door?

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:50.600
Yes. Ready?

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:53.100
When you open the door 
suddenly, like this...

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:59.110
Hinagiku-san is almost 
always inside changing.

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:01.160
See?

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:05.700
I keep telling you to knock!

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:07.290
I'm sorry!

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:10.740
Yes, it really brings back memories.

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:14.590
And now Kayura-san has 
totally become one of us.

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:15.450
Seconds.

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:16.480
Sure.

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:18.250
I want seconds too, Hayate.

00:21:18.910 --> 00:21:20.300
Me too, Hayate-kun.

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:22.050
Me too! Me too!

00:21:22.350 --> 00:21:24.550
Sure. Just a moment.

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:26.530
Come on, Hayate! Hurry up!

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:34.420
Got something to do 
on the second floor?

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:36.770
Yes. I'm bringing up something 
Hinagiku-san forgot.

00:21:37.590 --> 00:21:41.280
It smelled a bit like smoke,
 so I deodorized it.

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:46.620
You're as thoughtful as ever.

00:21:46.620 --> 00:21:48.900
But you're way too unguarded.

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:50.300
Huh? I am?

00:21:50.850 --> 00:21:53.410
You should be a little more aware.

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:55.530
Try not to start any 
unnecessary battles.

00:21:55.530 --> 00:21:58.980
Right... Well, if it's you saying so,

00:21:58.980 --> 00:22:00.420
I'll be careful from now on.

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:06.110
People go through a lot 
when they're young,

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:09.430
but you shouldn't take what you 
feel right now too seriously.

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:11.430
What are you talking about?!

00:22:12.180 --> 00:22:17.000
I never realized I was 
so unguarded, though...

00:22:25.450 --> 00:22:27.190
Once again...

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:30.550
I keep telling you to knock!

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:32.910
I-I'm sorry!

00:24:05.820 --> 00:24:09.030
I guess we weren't very 
mature last week.

00:24:09.030 --> 00:24:11.340
Yeah. I felt sorry for her.

00:24:11.340 --> 00:24:13.580
Okay, let's do it for real this week!

00:24:13.580 --> 00:24:15.220
Nice Cutie!

00:24:15.220 --> 00:24:16.220
Hey!

00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:18.470
That wasn't right, was it?
